line	<str>Attempt to open the grill.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a rope on the grill.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Edmond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Put on the gas mask and climb up the pipe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go east and speak to Jethick; he will give you a book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north to the house against the wall (next to the rotten apple spawn).</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to open the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Martha Rehnison or Ted Rehnison in the house.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs and speak to Milli Rehnison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south of the town square to the large building along the southern wall with an "X" on the doors and a staircase inside going down. Attempt to open the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the large main building on the north side of the town square, north of the manhole.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Clerk in the main room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Bravek.</str>
line	
line	<str>:He will give you a scruffy note for a hangover cure.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the hangover cure on Bravek; he will give you a warrant.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Mourner house, the one with "X" on the doors and the stairwell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the barrel west of the staircase for a small key.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go downstairs, enter the cell, and speak to <col=800000>Elena</col>.</col>
